      "description": "Lower Body Strength\n\nLeg strength for cycling power and running economy\n\n1. Goblet Squat: 3 sets \u00d7 12 reps (Weight at chest, sit back into heels) [Rest: 60 sec]\n2. Romanian Deadlift: 3 sets \u00d7 10 reps (Hinge at hips, slight knee bend) [Rest: 60 sec]\n3. Walking Lunges: 3 sets \u00d7 10 reps each leg (Keep torso upright, knee tracks over toe) [Rest: 45 sec]\n4. Step-ups: 3 sets \u00d7 10 reps each leg (Use bench or box, drive through heel) [Rest: 45 sec]\n5. Calf Raises: 3 sets \u00d7 15 reps (Full range of motion, hold at top) [Rest: 30 sec]\n6. Single Leg Glute Bridge: 3 sets \u00d7 10 reps each leg (Keep hips level throughout) [Rest: 30 sec]\n\nBuild phase: increase weight, lower reps (6-10) for strength gains.\n\n[Duration: ~45 min]\n\n[Weekly Plan - Build]"
